boethius-4.md:1: argue/unfaithful: boethius-4.logic.r1 P3 (S3): the sentence has no word of "that license which thou believest to be permitted to the wicked were taken away": is it the sentence P3 came from?
boethius-4.logic.r1: argue/verdicts: valid as boethius-4.logic.r1, boethius-4.logic.r1.3 read it, not as the others do: which reading is right decides the verdict
